      "title": "Quand ?",
      "description": "Give dates, name the seasons, and ask questions with \"quand\".",
      "estimatedMinutes": 13,
      "sections": [
        {
          "type": "learn",
          "title": "Learn",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "heading": "Saying the date",
              "body": "For dates, French uses \"le\" + number + month: \"le trois mai\" (May 3rd). There is one exception: the first day of the month is \"le premier\" — \"le premier mai\" (May 1st).",
              "examples": [
                { "french": "Nous sommes le dix juin.", "english": "It is June 10th." },
                { "french": "Mon anniversaire est le premier mai.", "english": "My birthday is on May 1st." },
                { "french": "Le quatorze juillet, c'est la fête nationale.", "english": "July 14th is the national holiday." },
                { "french": "Noël, c'est le vingt-cinq décembre.", "english": "Christmas is on December 25th." },
                { "french": "Aujourd'hui, nous sommes le cinq octobre.", "english": "Today is October 5th." }
              ],
              "tip": "Never say \"le un mai\" — the first of the month is always \"le premier\"."
            },
            {
              "heading": "The four seasons",
              "body": "The seasons are: le printemps (spring), l'été (summer), l'automne (autumn) and l'hiver (winter). Say \"au printemps\", but \"en été\", \"en automne\" and \"en hiver\".",
              "examples": [
                { "french": "Au printemps, il y a des fleurs.", "english": "In spring, there are flowers." },
                { "french": "En été, je vais à la plage.", "english": "In summer, I go to the beach." },
                { "french": "En hiver, il fait froid.", "english": "In winter, it is cold." },
                { "french": "En automne, les vacances sont finies.", "english": "In autumn, the holidays are over." },
                { "french": "Ma saison préférée est l'été.", "english": "My favourite season is summer." }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
